@MusicMarket.Api_HostAddress = http://localhost:5036
@authToken = eyJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiIsInR5cCI6IkpXVCJ9...

### 1. Register a Seller User
POST {{MusicMarket.Api_HostAddress}}/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Kasun Perera",
  "email": "kasun@musicmarket.lk",
  "password": "Password123!",
  "role": "seller",
  "phoneNumber": "+94771234567"
}

### 2. Login to obtain JWT Token
POST {{MusicMarket.Api_HostAddress}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "kasun@musicmarket.lk",
  "password": "Password123!"
}

### 3. Create Listing [Authorize, multipart/form-data]
# Note: When using VS Code REST Client or Swagger UI, upload real image files
POST {{MusicMarket.Api_HostAddress}}/api/listings
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=----WebKitFormBoundary7MA4YWxkTrZu0gW

------WebKitFormBoundary7MA4YWxkTrZu0gW
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="Title"

Fender Player Stratocaster - Polar White (Mint Condition)
------WebKitFormBoundary7MA4YWxkTrZu0gW
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="Category"

Electric Guitar
------WebKitFormBoundary7MA4YWxkTrZu0gW
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="Brand"

Fender
------WebKitFormBoundary7MA4YWxkTrZu0gW
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="Model"

Player Stratocaster
------WebKitFormBoundary7MA4YWxkTrZu0gW
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="Condition"

excellent
------WebKitFormBoundary7MA4YWxkTrZu0gW
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="Year"

2022
------WebKitFormBoundary7MA4YWxkTrZu0gW
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="ListingType"

Sell
------WebKitFormBoundary7MA4YWxkTrZu0gW
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="Price"

240000
------WebKitFormBoundary7MA4YWxkTrZu0gW
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="Location"

Colombo 07
------WebKitFormBoundary7MA4YWxkTrZu0gW
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="Description"

Bought brand new, barely used at home. Includes Fender gig bag and whammy bar.
------WebKitFormBoundary7MA4YWxkTrZu0gW--

### 4. Get Public Listings with Filters and Pagination
GET {{MusicMarket.Api_HostAddress}}/api/listings?category=Electric%20Guitar&status=LIVE&page=1&pageSize=12
Accept: application/json

### 5. Get Listing by ID (Public Full Details)
GET {{MusicMarket.Api_HostAddress}}/api/listings/1
Accept: application/json

### 6. Get Current User's Listings [Authorize]
GET {{MusicMarket.Api_HostAddress}}/api/listings/mine
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Accept: application/json

### 7. Update Listing Price [Authorize, Owner Only]
PUT {{MusicMarket.Api_HostAddress}}/api/listings/1/price
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "newPrice": 225000
}

### 8. Get Instrument Catalog (All Models)
GET {{MusicMarket.Api_HostAddress}}/api/catalog
Accept: application/json

### 9. Get Instrument Catalog Filtered by Category
GET {{MusicMarket.Api_HostAddress}}/api/catalog?category=Acoustic%20Guitar
Accept: application/json

### 10. Create a Saved Search Alert [Authorize]
POST {{MusicMarket.Api_HostAddress}}/api/alerts
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Fender Guitars Under 300k",
  "category": "Electric Guitar",
  "brand": "Fender",
  "maxPrice": 300000,
  "conditions": "new,like_new,excellent"
}

### 11. Get My Alerts [Authorize]
GET {{MusicMarket.Api_HostAddress}}/api/alerts
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Accept: application/json

### 12. Add to Wishlist [Authorize]
POST {{MusicMarket.Api_HostAddress}}/api/wishlist/1
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Accept: application/json

### 13. Get My Wishlist [Authorize]
GET {{MusicMarket.Api_HostAddress}}/api/wishlist
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Accept: application/json

### 14. Get Notifications [Authorize]
GET {{MusicMarket.Api_HostAddress}}/api/notifications
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Accept: application/json
